{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "b99f13c513469d6edfafd45eed6fe83831e2355872ac848b6ea02e5259c591f3", "ja": "想い出の1ページ", "zh": "回忆的1页", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8cdd6d98ae1b9edda9fc686c552d94efe6b3f17f5ab551d0cf979868ccbd5bdf", "ja": "ファンミーティングは大盛況に終わった。\nお悩み相談の難しさを感じながらも、何かに\n悩むことも青春だと感じたふたりは、ファン\nと共に過ごした今日という1ページを、大切\nな思い出として心に刻むのだった。", "zh": "粉丝见面会在一片热烈气氛中圆满结束了。  \n两人感受到了烦恼咨询的困难，  \n也体会到，为某件事烦恼同样是青春，  \n于是将与粉丝共度的今天这一页1，作为珍贵的回忆铭刻在心中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "42e8df5389160f828ffdb8e40448c54cbf3b2ae326b4241b0989205b2c9a36df", "ja": "（Cleaskyファンミーティングは大盛況！　\nお陰で、リバイバル公演も上手くいきそうだ）", "zh": "（Cleasky粉丝见面会大获成功！多亏了这次活动，复刻公演看来也能顺利进行下去了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a7dc1b06b56fd58b07299e8a6a6632d441392953f98201f3c48bdfc3c5902f86", "ja": "美也、エレナ、お疲れ様！\nすごく良いイベントだったよ。", "zh": "美也、艾琳娜，辛苦了！\n真是一场非常棒的活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "33db265e9ab3a9045e36aa4a2b37f3a9f575b81e96ed792778499cdb6b8ed21e", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nエヘヘ、ありがと！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n嘿嘿，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "5612fc5461c6af95871a95d8f189e5db9df584d19c421e998b8a7db8720e4e49", "ja": "ファンのみなさんのおかげで、\n私たちも、楽しい時間を過ごせましたよ～。", "zh": "多亏了各位粉丝，我们也度过了一段愉快的时光哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "7b0051ea1aa3ffc780522c5b361f97539f26bd363b826d2a1b63920ff67a8bc1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、素敵なイベントを\n考えてくれて、ありがとうございました～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你\n为我们策划了这么棒的活动～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "26008608a3aa2c9aba415341fd0152b9fa920e4d2ff365c3221bb929768f90cf", "ja": "どういたしまして。ファンのみんなも\n喜んでくれたみたいだし、何よりだよ。", "zh": "不客气。粉丝们好像也都很开心，这比什么都好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "20317280192f9cd375c91f52b78ec7633e822e3fa7e12f5b87dccfdba5aa109b", "ja": "あっ、そういえば……！\nミヤは、思い出した？　悩みごと……。", "zh": "啊，说起来……！\n美也，你想起了吗？烦恼的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "e8601b1fb46175bf02d85778b5f3f435043651ce13150cfdc76c50a874911620", "ja": "おや～？　……お悩みに答えるのに精いっぱいで、\n悩みを思い出すのを、すっかり忘れていましたな～。", "zh": "哎呀～？……光顾着回答烦恼了，\n结果把自己的烦恼忘得一干二净了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "259af313bbad1704a15a23320087610d6cfc852fbe9ce7d1907ab80fc6147ed8", "ja": "やっぱり！\nワタシもだヨ～！　エヘヘ♪", "zh": "果然是这样！\n我也一样哦～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d712088697f80720b813549fc3b304689f1a87a0a14abbc713ddd5f0851919e4", "ja": "まあ、頑張らないと思い出せないくらい\n悩みがないなら、それは良い事だしな。", "zh": "不过，要是烦恼少到不努力去想就想不起来，\n那也是件好事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "09bce5e53effe9c97e536eec816b84ba347fdbbd2b41665703080b1fc6f3f65f", "ja": "あ、そっか！　そうだよネ！\nアハハッ♪", "zh": "啊，原来如此！确实是这样呢！\n啊哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0ce4a8b412e623095cbe67b407b1799d2e9dfaca4b1b44e36a4c3fcad3f0146d", "ja": "けど、何か悩みができたら、\nいつでも相談してくれ。", "zh": "不过，要是遇到什么烦恼，随时都可以来找我商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "d8a66006a3a78f65a0490274c7e075e3d515bc1a135eb96e1ee08d8a1c53da2e", "ja": "はい～。お悩みに答えるのは難しかったので、\n今度は相談する人になりたいです～。", "zh": "好的～因为回答烦恼很难，所以这次想成为来咨询的人～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "698f5792f5b18cffdc4a72cf03a7b45c75b84853d4229d6bd9b60a5934b8e521", "ja": "それに、何かに悩むことも\n青春って感じがしましたから～。", "zh": "而且，为某件事烦恼，也让我觉得很有青春气息呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "9327dca1a9e1a7697d65b1c739da14f157aecde8f3e085a7023d7ab61602bc97", "ja": "したした！　なんかキュンとして……\nムズムズする感じ！", "zh": "对对！总觉得心里怦怦的……\n还有种坐立不安的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "174ccf58ebdb3984ea4e1e4b7768cb58030c4ab3564a94b30e3340530a174e39", "ja": "悩んだりつまづいたり、上手くいかない事を\n経験するのも青春だよな。俺にもそんな日があったし。", "zh": "经历烦恼、遭遇挫折、体会不顺利，也都是青春啊。我也有过那样的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "6ffc49b686f4e52c95938488bf9b43c90e674ee12166b24427ce389f246eb68a", "ja": "え？　{$P$}の青春は、\nワタシたちと一緒に続いてるんでしょ？", "zh": "诶？{$P$}的青春，不是还在和我们一起延续着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "ad1c7736356eb32ea342fe13bb1c2a2810f0051bfea6df7ccb3f353fc3b8cdcd", "ja": "そうですよ～。{$P$}さんの\n青春は、まだまだ終わりませんよ～。", "zh": "没错哦～。{$P$}先生的青春，还远远没有结束哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2df81d48d7d224576e3850e73a65a926b7c24f657672c5f7b59a748756dcbf71", "ja": "はは、そうだったな。俺達は今、\nかけがえのない時間の中にいるってことだな！", "zh": "哈哈，说得对。我们现在正身处这段无可替代的时光之中啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "644251d1c756b27cf831d9c7f5c4ad8e10df797d539fb3c5bb8b77238ce09222", "ja": "はい～。今日のことも、\n忘れられない大切な思い出になりそうです～。", "zh": "是呀～今天的事，也会成为一段难以忘怀的珍贵回忆呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "a01015fd4493ba10bafa8476ec749b83d31e1b3694752ba1cecdb41a96641469", "ja": "そうだネ！　ファンミーティング、\nすっごく楽しかったし、またやりたいナ♪", "zh": "没错！粉丝见面会特别开心，我还想再办一次呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f3994317d0c7e4458cb06963d36b682a9b0ccf61b0e160ddeb62e8f2bbe2385f", "ja": "そうだな。\nその前に、リバイバル公演があるけどな！", "zh": "是啊。\n不过在那之前，还有复刻公演呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "d008226a65c9c3e321f0b5d7aac9700ec91785c2d80fe8e33bacdc4eec7ed41d", "ja": "あ、そうだったヨー！　エヘヘ……♪\n公演も最高の思い出にしようネ、ミヤ！", "zh": "啊，对哦——！嘿嘿……♪\n演出也要成为最棒的回忆哦，美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "60b286f823d1434c65a9d20d018411713d8a6327de96fb01a0166c4ced2c60d2", "ja": "はい～。何回でもファンミーティングをして、何回でも\nリバイバル公演ができるよう、がんばりましょう～。", "zh": "好的～我们要一次又一次地举办粉丝见面会，努力让复出演出也能举办一次又一次～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0229_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_05_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "376b71ced9d5906d92396ab769c9d9a767da3e04b06d9a7b6eb63b84914360fb", "ja": "おーっ♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
